poyYzfoQwg-BYcjbxgQ","date":"2013-12-15T00:50:42","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9214458465576172,"text_excerpt":"Just moved to NOLA from NY and I gotta say the pizza is awesome!!! I tried many places down here and some are way too overpriced! The pizza here is affordable and great! Try it you wont be dissappointed!! The wings are also the best I'm not even over exaggerating !"},{"business_id":"R6zldMXLOXDL5biSER8hHA","review_id":"Qb0bLdvxdfxH4u9gGj7TQw","date":"2017-12-19T15:08:06","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9156773686408997,"text_excerpt":"I've eaten here so many times and it's the same all of the time. The customer service is on point and whatnot. Prices are reasonable and not only that, it's locally owned. It's a black owned establishment to say. I have to continue to support the community. Way better than major chain pizza joints."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
